msgstr ""

#. Context: Negotiation lines for one demon personality. File name suggests 'cynic'.
#. Limit: Text box: 3 lines of 40 letters (20 tiles, 2 letters per tile). The build re-wraps lines, so
#. line breaks are only hints. If a line needs more room, add [wait][box] to start another box.
#. Tags: [box] = start a new text box; [wait] = wait for the player to press a button.
#. Same Japanese also at: COMBDATA/CYNI.EVE#31.
#: COMBDATA/CYNI.EVE:551
msgctxt "COMBDATA/CYNI.EVE#551"
msgid ""
"意図的に無視しているとしか、思えない。[box]そんなに、俺のことが嫌いか？\n"
"[wait]俺は俺が好きだ。\n"
"[wait]たまらん。"
msgstr ""

#. Context: Negotiation lines for one demon personality. File name suggests 'cynic'.
#. Limit: Text box: 3 lines of 40 letters (20 tiles, 2 letters per tile). The build re-wraps lines, so
#. line breaks are only hints. If a line needs more room, add [wait][box] to start another box.
#. Tags: [box] = start a new text box; [pause] = short pause in the text; [wait] = wait for the player
#. to press a button.
#: COMBDATA/CYNI.EVE:552
msgctxt "COMBDATA/CYNI.EVE#552"
msgid ""
"う[pause]うっそ。\n"
"[wait]俺にもとどめを刺す気かい。\n"
"[wait]ひじょーに、[pause]やめて欲しい。[box]かわりに、きみんとこで使われてる、\n"
"俺の仲間を好きに扱っていいぞ。\n"
"[wait]いやいや、まじで。[box]じゃ、[pause]そういうことで。"
msgstr ""
